_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-11-22&amp;utm_content=highlight-1#google-expands-connected-apps-grocery-54e4a9" style="color:#5A42F4;text-decoration:none">閱讀完整新聞 &#8594;</a></div></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:9px 25px 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #DEDBD2;border-top:4px solid #3F5BC8;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td style="padding:17px"><div style="font:800 11px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#3F5BC8">02 / 廣告平台 &amp; 行銷科技 · 可即用</div><div style="font:800 18px/1.4 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-top:11px"><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-11-22&amp;utm_content=highlight-2#creatify-connects-ad-research-creative-c4f275" style="color:#101114;text-decoration:none">Creatify Max串接廣告研究、素材與推出審批</a></div><div style="font:13px/1.65 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#4B4D55;padding-top:9px">Creatify推出Max，讓團隊從競品研究、素材製作到活動草擬，在Creatify或Slack內處理。</div><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin-top:12px;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td bgcolor="#EBE8FF" style="border-left:3px solid #5A42F4;background:#EBE8FF;padding:10px 12px"><div style="font:800 10px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#5A42F4">MARKETER TAKEAWAY</div><div style="font:13px/1.6 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-top:4px">創意與媒體操作由同一代理銜接，投放團隊可決定哪些建議需逐次審閱，哪些固定檢查適合設成例行工作。</div></td></tr></table><div style="font:700 12px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;padding-top:11px"><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-11-22&amp;utm_content=highli