A42F4;text-decoration:none">閱讀完整新聞 &#8594;</a></div></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:9px 25px 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #DEDBD2;border-top:4px solid #39689F;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td style="padding:17px"><div style="font:800 11px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#39689F">04 / AI 大模型 &amp; 市場動態 · 可即用</div><div style="font:800 16px/1.4 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-top:11px"><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-11-22&amp;utm_content=highlight-4#gemini-previews-demand-tool-schemas-278dc9" style="color:#101114;text-decoration:none">Gemini API預覽按需載入工具規格，減少預先放入的內容</a></div><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin-top:12px;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td bgcolor="#EBE8FF" style="border-left:3px solid #5A42F4;background:#EBE8FF;padding:10px 12px"><div style="font:800 10px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#5A42F4">MARKETER TAKEAWAY</div><div style="font:13px/1.6 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-top:4px">串接大量行銷工具的團隊可調整代理每次請求要接收的規格，決定哪些常用工具預先載入，哪些按需搜尋。</div></td></tr></table><div style="font:700 12px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;padding-top:11px"><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-11-22&amp;utm_content=highlight-4#gemini-previews-demand-tool-schemas-278dc9" style="color:#5A42F4;text-decoration:none">閱讀完整新聞 &#8594;</a></div></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:9px 25px 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid 